--- !u!114 &348603373
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 348603368}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: bfae3abed1ca29f40acbb0b10e8c8a50, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::IntroCutscene
  dialoguePanel: {fileID: 904400403}
  narratorName: {fileID: 1954216278}
  dialogueText: {fileID: 1510750720}
  continueButton: {fileID: 1545224288}
  continueIndicator: {fileID: 964989283}
  dialogueBackground: {fileID: 1009342093}
  characters:
  - name: Bee
    image: {fileID: 828715761}
  - name: Fable
    image: {fileID: 1133684755}
  narratorNameText: 
  fableImage: {fileID: 1133684755}
  beeImage: {fileID: 828715761}
  fableName: Fable
  beeName: Bee
  migratedToRoster: 1
  activeColor: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  inactiveColor: {r: 0.4, g: 0.4, b: 0.4, a: 1}
  lightingSpeed: 10
  jumpHeight: 30
  jumpDuration: 0.3
  charsPerSecond: 45
  talkSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 461440c23d1f4b740a14e1117232427b, type: 3}
  talkVolume: 1
  talkTickInterval: 0.08
  talkPitchVariation: 0.05
  fadeOverlay: {fileID: 0}
  fadeInDuration: 1.68
  fadeOutDuration: 1.09
  highlightTarget: {fileID: 404598250}
  dimColor: {r: 0.08, g: 0.08, b: 0.1, a: 0.8}
  overlaySortingOrder: 900
  playerMovement: {fileID: 1258914511}
  defaultCast:
  - Fable
  - Bee
  dialogueLines:
  - speakerName: Fable
    text: Hello?
    expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c42580176f456604f98d46beaf53e8d1, type: 3}
    highlightBoon: 0
    speaker: 0
  - speakerName: Bee
    text: 'Hi '
    expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 71afd245b83be654b82da840234a7142, type: 3}
    highlightBoon: 0
    speaker: 1
  - speakerName: Fable
    text: 'is that your shop? '
    expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: db08fb52dcfdacd47b0ec9efba0865cd, type: 3}
    highlightBoon: 0
    speaker: 0
  - speakerName: Bee
    text: Yup!
    expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1fdc66ac7a754e541b5a541389a61f7f, type: 3}
    highlightBoon: 0
    speaker: 1
  cutscenes:
  - id: Card Tutorial
    tutorialMode: 1
    castNames:
    - Bee
    lines:
    - speakerName: Bee
      text: Nice find! This Card lets you fight back. Aim with the mouse and left
        click to throw it at an enemy.
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a0a48ebf8b8fc5d42941af87cfb1c01f, type: 3}
      highlightBoon: 1
      speaker: 1
    - speakerName: Bee
      text: A card only flies a short way before it drops, and every throw uses some
        of your Meter, so make your throws count.
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a0a48ebf8b8fc5d42941af87cfb1c01f, type: 3}
      highlightBoon: 1
      speaker: 1
    - speakerName: Bee
      text: Hit an enemy with a card and a card battle begins!
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a0a48ebf8b8fc5d42941af87cfb1c01f, type: 3}
      highlightBoon: 1
      speaker: 1
    - speakerName: Bee
      text: Press E to switch between the items you carry. Some trinkets can be thrown
        or used too.
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a0a48ebf8b8fc5d42941af87cfb1c01f, type: 3}
      highlightBoon: 1
      speaker: 1
    - speakerName: Bee
      text: This is your Boon Meter. Every enemy you fight fills it up a little.
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a0a48ebf8b8fc5d42941af87cfb1c01f, type: 3}
      highlightBoon: 1
      speaker: 1
    - speakerName: Bee
      text: 'When it is full, you get to Choose Your Boon: pick one of the upgrades
        on offer.'
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a0a48ebf8b8fc5d42941af87cfb1c01f, type: 3}
      highlightBoon: 1
      speaker: 1
    - speakerName: Bee
      text: Boons are permanent. You can gain extra hands per battle, a bigger hand
        size, or more Wind Power on every hand you play.
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a0a48ebf8b8fc5d42941af87cfb1c01f, type: 3}
      highlightBoon: 1
      speaker: 1
    - speakerName: Bee
      text: Any extra meter carries over to the next boon, so keep fighting. Good
        luck out there!
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a0a48ebf8b8fc5d42941af87cfb1c01f, type: 3}
      highlightBoon: 1
      speaker: 1
    onStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    castMode: 1
  - id: Shop Ruin
    tutorialMode: 0
    castNames:
    - Bee
    - Fable
    lines:
    - speakerName: Bee
      text: Write your dialogue here.
      expression: {fileID: 0}
      highlightBoon: 0
      speaker: 2
    - speakerName: Fable
      text: Write your dialogue here.
      expression: {fileID: 0}
      highlightBoon: 0
      speaker: 2
    onStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    castMode: 1
  - id: Star Intro
    tutorialMode: 0
    castNames:
    - Bee
    - Fable
    lines:
    - speakerName: Bee
      text: "Oh, hey! You\u2019re awake! Welcome, welcome!"
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 71afd245b83be654b82da840234a7142, type: 3}
      highlightBoon: 0
      speaker: 2
    - speakerName: Fable
      text: Where am I?
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: db08fb52dcfdacd47b0ec9efba0865cd, type: 3}
      highlightBoon: 0
      speaker: 2
    - speakerName: Bee
      text: "Eh, don\u2019t worry about that for now! Say, see those stars lying
        around?"
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1fdc66ac7a754e541b5a541389a61f7f, type: 3}
      highlightBoon: 0
      speaker: 2
    - speakerName: Bee
      text: "Why don\u2019t you collect at least five? We might need them later!"
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a0a48ebf8b8fc5d42941af87cfb1c01f, type: 3}
      highlightBoon: 0
      speaker: 2
    - speakerName: Fable
      text: And then?
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b5cd3a40079ea4448b9f4938b0ed5bc6, type: 3}
      highlightBoon: 0
      speaker: 2
    - speakerName: Bee
      text: "Then come find me! I\u2019ll be right here. Probably."
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1cce7b918884e9747af94288bc0a51ea, type: 3}
      highlightBoon: 0
      speaker: 2
    onStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    castMode: 1
  - id: Star Reminder
    tutorialMode: 0
    castNames:
    - Bee
    lines:
    - speakerName: Bee
      text: Go down below i remember seeing stars floating around there!
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1cce7b918884e9747af94288bc0a51ea, type: 3}
      highlightBoon: 0
      speaker: 2
    onStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    castMode: 1
  - id: Star Complete
    tutorialMode: 0
    castNames:
    - Bee
    - Fable
    lines:
    - speakerName: Bee
      text: Well, well! Look who found all five!
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 71afd245b83be654b82da840234a7142, type: 3}
      highlightBoon: 0
      speaker: 2
    - speakerName: Fable
      text: I got them. Now what?
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b5cd3a40079ea4448b9f4938b0ed5bc6, type: 3}
      highlightBoon: 0
      speaker: 2
    onStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    castMode: 1
  - id: Star Done
    tutorialMode: 0
    castNames:
    - Bee
    - Fable
    lines:
    - speakerName: Bee
      text: Good question! Now that I see you can collect all those stars on your
        own
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a0a48ebf8b8fc5d42941af87cfb1c01f, type: 3}
      highlightBoon: 0
      speaker: 2
    - speakerName: Bee
      text: "let\u2019s see if you can actually defend yourself out there."
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a0a48ebf8b8fc5d42941af87cfb1c01f, type: 3}
      highlightBoon: 0
      speaker: 2
    - speakerName: Bee
      text: Come on hit me with one of your cards!
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 71afd245b83be654b82da840234a7142, type: 3}
      highlightBoon: 0
      speaker: 2
    onStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    castMode: 1
  - id: Star Next Step
    tutorialMode: 0
    castNames:
    - Bee
    - Fable
    lines:
    - speakerName: Bee
      text: Good question! Now that I see you can collect all those stars on your
        own
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a0a48ebf8b8fc5d42941af87cfb1c01f, type: 3}
      highlightBoon: 0
      speaker: 2
    - speakerName: Bee
      text: "let\u2019s see if you can actually defend yourself out there"
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a0a48ebf8b8fc5d42941af87cfb1c01f, type: 3}
      highlightBoon: 0
      speaker: 2
    - speakerName: Bee
      text: Come on hit me with one of your cards!
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 71afd245b83be654b82da840234a7142, type: 3}
      highlightBoon: 0
      speaker: 2
    onStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    castMode: 1
  - id: After Card Game
    tutorialMode: 0
    castNames:
    - Bee
    - Fable
    lines:
    - speakerName: Bee
      text: Great now that you know how to fight
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 71afd245b83be654b82da840234a7142, type: 3}
      highlightBoon: 0
      speaker: 2
    - speakerName: Bee
      text: 'Ill meet you at the end of the road '
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a0a48ebf8b8fc5d42941af87cfb1c01f, type: 3}
      highlightBoon: 0
      speaker: 2
    - speakerName: Fable
      text: Okay
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b5cd3a40079ea4448b9f4938b0ed5bc6, type: 3}
      highlightBoon: 0
      speaker: 2
    onStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    castMode: 1
  - id: Ending Intro
    tutorialMode: 0
    castNames:
    - Bee
    - Fable
    lines:
    - speakerName: Bee
      text: Hey! you made it!
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 71afd245b83be654b82da840234a7142, type: 3}
      highlightBoon: 0
      speaker: 2
    - speakerName: Fable
      text: How are you so fast?
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: db08fb52dcfdacd47b0ec9efba0865cd, type: 3}
      highlightBoon: 0
      speaker: 2
    - speakerName: Bee
      text: Dont worry about that
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1fdc66ac7a754e541b5a541389a61f7f, type: 3}
      highlightBoon: 0
      speaker: 2
    - speakerName: Fable
      text: Okay
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b5cd3a40079ea4448b9f4938b0ed5bc6, type: 3}
      highlightBoon: 0
      speaker: 2
    - speakerName: Bee
      text: Anyways help me collect 10 stars and ill lead you to the village!
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a0a48ebf8b8fc5d42941af87cfb1c01f, type: 3}
      highlightBoon: 0
      speaker: 2
    onStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    castMode: 1
  - id: Ending Reminder
    tutorialMode: 0
    castNames:
    - Bee
    - Fable
    lines:
    - speakerName: Bee
      text: 'Dont forget to get me those 10 stars '
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 71afd245b83be654b82da840234a7142, type: 3}
      highlightBoon: 0
      speaker: 2
    onStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    castMode: 1
  - id: Ending Complete
    tutorialMode: 0
    castNames:
    - Bee
    - Fable
    lines:
    - speakerName: Bee
      text: Nice!
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a0a48ebf8b8fc5d42941af87cfb1c01f, type: 3}
      highlightBoon: 0
      speaker: 2
    - speakerName: Bee
      text: Thanks for helping me find those
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 71afd245b83be654b82da840234a7142, type: 3}
      highlightBoon: 0
      speaker: 2
    - speakerName: Fable
      text: So what now?
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b5cd3a40079ea4448b9f4938b0ed5bc6, type: 3}
      highlightBoon: 0
      speaker: 2
    - speakerName: Bee
      text: Ill show you around the village!
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a0a48ebf8b8fc5d42941af87cfb1c01f, type: 3}
      highlightBoon: 0
      speaker: 2
    - speakerName: Bee
      text: Follow me!
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 71afd245b83be654b82da840234a7142, type: 3}
      highlightBoon: 0
      speaker: 2
    onStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    castMode: 1
  - id: Card Game Intro
    tutorialMode: 0
    castNames: []
    lines:
    - speakerName: 
      text: Write your dialogue here.
      expression: {fileID: 0}
      highlightBoon: 0
