  shopkeeperName: Shopkeeper
  charsPerSecond: 45
  talkSound: {fileID: 0}
  talkVolume: 1
  talkTickInterval: 0.08
  talkPitchVariation: 0.05
  greetingLines:
  - Psst! Come take a look at what I've got!
  - Welcome, welcome! Have a look around the trunk.
  - Ah, a customer! Take your pick!
  boughtLines:
  - Excellent choice! The {item} is all yours.
  - Ooh, the {item}! You have good taste.
  - Take good care of that {item}!
  reshuffleLines:
  - Hold on, let me dig through the trunk again...
  - Fresh stock, coming right up!
  - I've got plenty more in the back!
  fullLines:
  - Your pockets are full! Sell something first.
  - Five is the limit, friend. Sell one in your bag!
  - No room left! Open your bag and sell a trinket.
  soldLines:
  - Hmm, the {item}. I'll take it off your hands.
  - Sold! Now you have room for something new.
  - The {item}, eh? Fine, fine.
  brokeLines:
  - Hmm, you're a few batteries short, friend.
  - Come back when you've got more batteries!
  - I don't do credit. Batteries first!
  sugarRushLines:
  - Whoa, that's a lot of candy... SUGAR RUSH!
  - Careful now, you're vibrating!
